# Nix Config

Personal Nix configuration, heavily based upon https://github.com/mitchellh/nixos-config

A system is a machine (`machines/<name>.nix`) combined with a user
(`users/<user>/darwin.nix` + `users/<user>/home-manager.nix`) in `flake.nix`.
Nix itself is installed with Determinate Nix, so nix-darwin does not manage it.

    make switch NIXNAME=personal-macbook-air-m1
